30
00:02:11.275 --> 00:02:15.008
Geo index (Redis GEO, or geohash or H3 keys).

31
00:02:15.288 --> 00:02:17.741
A rider's path for a day, for 7 days:

32
00:02:18.021 --> 00:02:22.864
Wide-column, LSM-based, TTL-expiring (Cassandra or ScyllaDB).

33
00:02:23.144 --> 00:02:24.765
