110
00:05:55.095 --> 00:05:55.948
Strengths:

111
00:05:56.228 --> 00:06:00.665
Sub-ms reads or writes, TTLs, atomic ops, simple scaling.

112
00:06:00.945 --> 00:06:01.927
Weaknesses:

113
00:06:02.207 --> 00:06:05.001
No queries by value; memory cost (Redis).

114
00:06:05.281 --> 00:06:06.241
Examples:

115
