121
00:06:22.217 --> 00:06:23.071
Strengths:

122
00:06:23.351 --> 00:06:27.148
Flexible schema, aggregates read in one fetch, rich queries.

123
00:06:27.428 --> 00:06:28.409
Weaknesses:

124
00:06:28.689 --> 00:06:32.828
Cross-document transactions are limited or costly; joins are weak.

125
00:06:33.108 --> 00:06:34.068
Examples:

126
