237
00:10:53.721 --> 00:10:57.348
It runs to 14 lines; the full listing is in the chapter.

238
00:11:00.198 --> 00:11:01.542
Here is a quick table:

239
00:11:01.822 --> 00:11:04.403
Rule, and Embed when..., and Reference when....

240
00:11:04.683 --> 00:11:05.537
Ownership.

241
00:11:05.817 --> 00:11:06.819
Embed when...:

242
00:11:07.099 --> 00:11:10.385
The child only exists with the parent (variants, nutrition).

243
00:11:10.665 --> 00:11:11.753
Reference when...:

244
00:11:12.033 --> 00:11:15.510
The child is shared (a brand used by 400 products).

245
00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:16.665
Access.

246
00:11:16.945 --> 00:11:17.947
Embed when...:

247
00:11:18.227 --> 00:11:19.550
Always read together.

248
00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:20.918
Reference when...:

249
00:11:21.198 --> 00:11:23.054
Read independently or rarely.

250
00:11:23.334 --> 00:11:24.166
Size.

251
00:11:24.446 --> 00:11:25.449
Embed when...:

252
00:11:25.729 --> 00:11:27.691
Bounded (a handful of variants).

253
00:11:27.971 --> 00:11:29.059
Reference when...:

254
00:11:29.339 --> 00:11:32.902
Unbounded (reviews, order history), then separate collection.

255
00:11:33.182 --> 00:11:34.185
Change rate.

256
00:11:34.465 --> 00:11:35.467
Embed when...:

257
00:11:35.747 --> 00:11:37.134
Changes with the parent.

258
00:11:37.414 --> 00:11:38.502
Reference when...:

259
00:11:38.782 --> 00:11:44.307
Changes independently and often (price, stock), then keep out of the catalog document.

260
00:11:45.657 --> 00:11:46.404
Warning:

261
00:11:46.684 --> 00:11:49.969
Unbounded arrays are the document-model N+1.

262
00:11:50.249 --> 00:11:59.636
Embedding all 20,000 reviews in the product document creates huge documents, slow updates and 16 MB limits (in MongoDB).

263
00:11:59.916 --> 00:12:06.935
Put reviews in their own collection keyed by product, and embed only a summary (ratingAvg, ratingCount).

264
00:12:08.285 --> 00:12:10.930
PostgreSQL JSONB is often enough.

