00:30:41.630 --> 00:30:43.038
Context and Problem.

637
00:30:43.318 --> 00:30:53.963
Location pings in the orders PostgreSQL caused vacuum debt, WAL-driven replica lag and I or O contention with checkout (§1.1).

638
00:30:54.243 --> 00:30:54.947
