00:30:56.851 --> 00:30:57.683
Goals:

641
00:30:57.963 --> 00:31:12.043
20 K pings per second at festival peak with headroom; latest position and radius queries 10 ms p99; 7-day path history; complete isolation from the orders database; rebuildable stores.

642
00:31:12.323 --> 00:31:18.937
Non-goals: dispatch algorithms (Ch 47); long-term analytics modeling (Ch 21).

